# Baked into the client bundle by `vite build` (CI). Not secret — these values
# ship in public JS. Runtime-configurable things do NOT belong here.

# SmartServ manual-Q&A sidecar (github.com/BasinSmurf/SmartServ). The shop WO
# launcher button health-probes this origin from the tech's browser and stays
# hidden unless it answers 200 — must be HTTPS (mixed content) and reachable
# from tech devices, hence the NPM-proxied public hostname.
VITE_EQUIPMENT_QA_URL=https://sidecar.basinsafetyus.com
